              for  use  with  either  _f_l_e_x  or  _l_e_x_.   Scanners  also  include
              YYYY__FFLLEEXX__MMAAJJOORR__VVEERRSSIIOONN and YYYY__FFLLEEXX__MMIINNOORR__VVEERRSSIIOONN indicating which
              version of _f_l_e_x generated the scanner (for example, for the  2.5
              release, these defines would be 2 and 5 respectively).

